                                        "entry_id": "23d7a040-54f6-34b5-b3f6-301f9de30b97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A body of rock (usually igneous) originally filling a fissure but now often rising above the older stratum as it is eroded away."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
